  "description": "The Modern Elegant Serif Font Bundle is a refined type collection crafted for timeless and sophisticated design. Blending classic serif elegance with modern proportions, this bundle delivers graceful letterforms with a contemporary touch.\nEach typeface is designed to shine in display use, offering clean contrast, balanced details, and elegant character. Perfect for editorial layouts, luxury branding, fashion visuals, and refined digital projects, these fonts bring a sense of class without feeling outdated. Whether you’re building a premium brand identity, designing editorial content, or creating elegant visual compositions, this font bundle provides a polished and versatile typographic foundation.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>The Modern Elegant Serif Font Bundle is a refined type collection crafted for timeless and sophisticated design. Blending classic serif elegance with modern proportions, this bundle delivers graceful letterforms with a contemporary touch.</p>\n<p>Each typeface is designed to shine in display use, offering clean contrast, balanced details, and elegant character. Perfect for editorial layouts, luxury branding, fashion visuals, and refined digital projects, these fonts bring a sense of class without feeling outdated. Whether you’re building a premium brand identity, designing editorial content, or creating elegant visual compositions, this font bundle provides a polished and versatile typographic foundation.</p>",
